    "identifier": "binding-fury-demonic-dance",
    "description": "<p>You spin around with your weapon, a dance-like attack that bewilders enemies. Make a melee Taijutsu attack, comparing the result against the AC of all creatures within your weapons range. On a hit, you deal your weapon damage+1d6. If you have Fury, you can spend it to increase this jutsu’s critical threat range by +2.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creatures cannot make an opportunity attack against you, until the beginning of their next turn.      At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
